==English==
[[Image:BlurryDavid.jpg|thumb|right|A blurry photo.]]

===Etymology===
{{suffix|blur|y|lang=en}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɜːri|lang=en}}

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|er}}

# {{context|of an image|lang=en}} Not [[clear]], [[crisp]], or [[focus]]ed; having [[fuzzy]] edges.
#: ''If I take off my glasses, everything close up looks '''blurry'''.''
# {{context|figuratively|lang=en}} not [[clear]], not with well-defined boundaries.
#: ''It would seem that the line between flirting and sexual harrassment has become quite '''blurry.'''''

====Derived terms====
* [[blurriness]]

